; --- 9 full-power steps up from the lowest hold (the cartridge far above the block at several temperatures: separates heat lost from the cartridge from heat lost from the block, K40) ---
M117 cal step up 170
M109 S170
G4 P90000          ; hold 170 after a full-power step
M117 cal step up 190
M109 S190
G4 P90000          ; hold 190 after a full-power step
M117 cal step up 210
M109 S210
G4 P90000          ; hold 210 after a full-power step
; --- 10 free cooling to 60 C ---
M117 cal free cooling
TURN_OFF_HEATERS
M106 S0
TEMPERATURE_WAIT SENSOR=extruder MAXIMUM=60
G1 X0 Y220 F3000
M84
M117 cal done
